cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Global Anthem Atlas: themes, Energy and Wisdom indices for the lyrics of national anthems and national songs"
version: 1.0.0
# date-released: YYYY-MM-DD   (set on publication)
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX (set after Zenodo reserves the DOI)
url: "https://github.com/KPRASANT9/atlas-awareness"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KPRASANT9/atlas-awareness"
authors:
  - name: "atlas-awareness"
    affiliation: "atlas-awareness"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
abstract: >-
  Lyrics-based theme profiles for 242 national anthems and national songs (254 songs listed, 219 countries and
  regions), with two descriptive indices (Energy = Mobilisation + Awakening; Wisdom = justice/peace, truth/virtue,
  future), 90% uncertainty intervals, an original-language etymology layer for 159 songs, per-country spectra
  and the full reproducible pipeline. Texts are included only where rights allow; all others can be rehydrated
  from pinned public sources and verified by hash. Code is MIT-licensed. Built with AI agents under the direction
  of the author, atlas-awareness, who is responsible for the content.
keywords:
  - national anthems
  - computational text analysis
  - nationalism
  - sentence embeddings
  - zero-shot classification
  - etymology
  - cultural analytics
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Datasheets for Datasets"
    authors:
      - family-names: Gebru
        given-names: Timnit
    journal: "Communications of the ACM"
    year: 2021
    doi: 10.1145/3458723
